  first | exact @GlobalTheory.ShFam.Hor.PolyBd.perVal_bound | exact GlobalTheory.ShFam.Hor.PolyBd.perVal_bound | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.ShFam.Hor.PolyBd.perVal_bound <;> assumption)
